{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/4c8aeb40b9c33505b3a12a21bbb41725.avif?t=1740573777\" width=800 height=224 /></span>After striking a secret deal with the king of the human kingdom, the Demon Lord has commanded you to create a special dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dungeon where the heroes of the kingdom will be satisfied as they clear it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the dungeon developer in the Demon Lord\u2019s castle, your task is to strategically place monsters and traps to craft this unique dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/738b4cdc66991616c9291542eeb3a1ba.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/13611cb79b85f2e2c4e03e360f5f8955.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/13611cb79b85f2e2c4e03e360f5f8955.webm?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/13611cb79b85f2e2c4e03e360f5f8955.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the secret deal with the human king, your goal is to 'lose' to the heroes invading the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While fighting in the dungeon with monsters and traps, you must still ensure the heroes emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a dungeon that allows the heroes to successfully clear it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/e03bc1d64903efbf02126a7ff0bc709e.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/0afa0a64796b3e26f92dc314420f9c5a.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/0afa0a64796b3e26f92dc314420f9c5a.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply losing to the heroes isn't enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the secret deal with the human king hidden, you must also meet the expectations based on each hero's role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the roles of 'Tank,' 'Damage Dealer,' and 'Healer' and create a dungeon that fulfills their needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/a114967d5ee6851eee6d5a6a0c95c7cd.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/6968a2fe312e3da7bc6e0b14d7b4868a.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/6968a2fe312e3da7bc6e0b14d7b4868a.webm?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/6968a2fe312e3da7bc6e0b14d7b4868a.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Royal Knights of the human kingdom, wild creatures invading the dungeon, ragtag heroes, noblemen's private soldiers, to veteran warriors...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you design your dungeon, you'll face numerous heroes and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keen judgment to overcome these challenges and create a dungeon that satisfies every hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/8a5e90d67c978d1334fb3d74e4672235.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/94a65ef249cf8454fe55b83ee126ed9c.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/94a65ef249cf8454fe55b83ee126ed9c.webm?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/94a65ef249cf8454fe55b83ee126ed9c.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the experience of a game developer\u2019s level design process, this game challenges you to design a dungeon that satisfies all the heroes while maintaining the right difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the work of a game developer firsthand with 'Dungeon Dev'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/ac4a0b03a523afabc35f5b56bb839e2f9be98232.jpg"},{"name":"Party Wipe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/6ff2486c8162c85ed7078ad33f47ea1985dfc541.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/354e277ac61bb13e8401b164947eb62969acfe17.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 1 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/8d874d839c221f602805663ddccd4df0c77a4f99.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/c42efa07f7ecb95177743ba8fa856c216a05b359.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 3 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/82445827a831f8d2614eca00a0265a0b6fcc39a2.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 4 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/82d488520abcdb20fa6adc58785998b6170134ec.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 5 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/f875e92ddf4f0c90be2955aa37f57b978695cfaa.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 6 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/9206c82f2750dd30a0ab05a82414b2f159b88cdc.jpg"},{"name":" Ferocious Animal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872750/a214fb7d2187fa26131c3496fc9b17fabc833ce0.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2872750?t=1740573777","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2872750?t=1740573777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/2caca9e95067d97f377e1acec5025330941efa13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740573777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/2caca9e95067d97f377e1acec5025330941efa13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740573777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Content Creation &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create and stream content as long as you include a link to the store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any other inquiries, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:teamettu@gmail.com\">teamettu@gmail.com</a></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/4c8aeb40b9c33505b3a12a21bbb41725.avif?t=1740573777\" width=800 height=224 /></span>After striking a secret deal with the king of the human kingdom, the Demon Lord has commanded you to create a special dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dungeon where the heroes of the kingdom will be satisfied as they clear it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the dungeon developer in the Demon Lord\u2019s castle, your task is to strategically place monsters and traps to craft this unique dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/738b4cdc66991616c9291542eeb3a1ba.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/13611cb79b85f2e2c4e03e360f5f8955.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/13611cb79b85f2e2c4e03e360f5f8955.webm?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/13611cb79b85f2e2c4e03e360f5f8955.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the secret deal with the human king, your goal is to 'lose' to the heroes invading the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While fighting in the dungeon with monsters and traps, you must still ensure the heroes emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a dungeon that allows the heroes to successfully clear it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/e03bc1d64903efbf02126a7ff0bc709e.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/0afa0a64796b3e26f92dc314420f9c5a.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/0afa0a64796b3e26f92dc314420f9c5a.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply losing to the heroes isn't enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the secret deal with the human king hidden, you must also meet the expectations based on each hero's role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the roles of 'Tank,' 'Damage Dealer,' and 'Healer' and create a dungeon that fulfills their needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/a114967d5ee6851eee6d5a6a0c95c7cd.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/6968a2fe312e3da7bc6e0b14d7b4868a.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/6968a2fe312e3da7bc6e0b14d7b4868a.webm?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/6968a2fe312e3da7bc6e0b14d7b4868a.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Royal Knights of the human kingdom, wild creatures invading the dungeon, ragtag heroes, noblemen's private soldiers, to veteran warriors...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you design your dungeon, you'll face numerous heroes and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keen judgment to overcome these challenges and create a dungeon that satisfies every hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/8a5e90d67c978d1334fb3d74e4672235.avif?t=1740573777\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/94a65ef249cf8454fe55b83ee126ed9c.poster.avif?t=1740573777\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/94a65ef249cf8454fe55b83ee126ed9c.webm?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/extras/94a65ef249cf8454fe55b83ee126ed9c.mp4?t=1740573777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the experience of a game developer\u2019s level design process, this game challenges you to design a dungeon that satisfies all the heroes while maintaining the right difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the work of a game developer firsthand with 'Dungeon Dev'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Team ETTU"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872750/header.jpg?t=1740573777","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872750/766389/fe7d0f91a777ab59986f0d8301ef4b9852f36c19/1750949453/dash_av1.mpd?t=1729659376","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872750/766389/fe7d0f91a777ab59986f0d8301ef4b9852f36c19/1750949453/dash_h264.mpd?t=1729659376","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2872750/766389/fe7d0f91a777ab59986f0d8301ef4b9852f36c19/1750949453/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1729659376","id":257061691,"name":"Dungeon Dev [Japanese]","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257061691/e37a58a16112943f43d8bfad0825205552d996a2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1729659376"}],"name":"Dungeon Dev","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free