st create a special dungeon that will satisfy the kingdom's heroes. Strategically place monsters and traps according to the roles of the heroes, such as &quot;Tank,&quot; &quot;Dealer,&quot; and &quot;Healer,&quot; to design this unique dungeon!","steam_appid":2872750,"support_info":{"email":"teamettu@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Korean, English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}